    ]
  },
  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "Lonnie Davis McCauley was born in Cleveland on September 19th, 1947. She attended high school at Lourdes Academy, received a B.A. in sociology from Cleveland State University, and a Master’s Degree in Library Science from Kent State University in 1999. As part of her master’s program, Lonnie interned at the prestigious Trinity College in Dublin, Ireland, achieving a lifelong dream, and also published her thesis, “The Irish Directory of Greater Cleveland”. Lonnie had a long and active history promoting Irish Culture and History with the Irish community..."
    ]
  },
